{"4719960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue Waves", "steam_appid": 4719960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5012310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/2fe2e1275b63159695f76a983fda079e.poster.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/2fe2e1275b63159695f76a983fda079e.webm?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Waves is a high-energy roguelike deckbuilder about surfing competitions, risky decisions, and sunny beaches filled with lovable weirdos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/741cc3d250fa210a9f3f1689ef2c8404.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every competition plays out in fast, strategic rounds. Each wave gives you limited space to play your tricks, chain combos and <strong>beat your rival’s score</strong> before an obstacle, a risky move gone wrong, or plain old bad math send you wiping out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/4e3e5e3575b327c70777bc8950bf97ed.poster.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/4e3e5e3575b327c70777bc8950bf97ed.webm?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/4e3e5e3575b327c70777bc8950bf97ed.mp4?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, none of that matters if you don't catch the <strong>perfect wave</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/b7b67cb32a6affac6d72d39e8d218dce.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you surf, you <strong>bid for the wave</strong> itself. Spend energy to outbid your rival and claim the best wave in the lineup, but every point you spend on the bid is energy you won’t have for your tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ride the perfect wave, or spend all your energy trying to steal it? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/cbccff822b9ba13eb07472ea1dd8e6fc.poster.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/cbccff822b9ba13eb07472ea1dd8e6fc.webm?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/cbccff822b9ba13eb07472ea1dd8e6fc.mp4?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's worse, a <strong>rogue wave</strong> can crash into the lineup at any moment: bigger rewards, bigger risk, and absolutely no warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/2bf9667f373d2aaa95eb02d2a9c72da0.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rival comes with their own unique effects and their own very specific issues, most of which are <strong>none of your business</strong> but all of which affect the score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/826185a674abde56c8e58d09a3469b93.poster.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/826185a674abde56c8e58d09a3469b93.webm?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/826185a674abde56c8e58d09a3469b93.mp4?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between competitions, you'll pick up <strong>stickers</strong> from shops and sponsors who just want to see their logo on a winning board. Combine the right ones, and the math starts working in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/12ad7100c8a59712df4df06e0fb6c83b.poster.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/12ad7100c8a59712df4df06e0fb6c83b.webm?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/12ad7100c8a59712df4df06e0fb6c83b.mp4?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring on demo:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🃏 Fully implemented <strong>Rookie</strong> deck with over 50 cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ 40+ stickers from suspicious sponsors with game-changing effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Wave-drafting system that rewards both strategic play and risk-taking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏄 6 rival surfers with unique effects that mess with your strategy </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧃 An irreverent surf world full of fake brands, strange locals and radical nonsense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️Rogue wave mechanic adds a layer of depth and danger to competitions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And remember: surf responsibly. Or don't. I'm not your mom.</strong> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/2fe2e1275b63159695f76a983fda079e.poster.avif?t=1787168866\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719960/extras/2fe2e1275b63159695f76a983fda079e.webm?t=1787168866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Waves is a high-energy roguelike deckbuilder about surfing competitions, risky decisions, and sunny beaches filled with lovable w